WEBVTT

00:04.799 --> 00:06.679
He is...
How should I put it?

00:07.040 --> 00:09.759
Someone who is pure
through and through.

00:10.080 --> 00:11.919
A straight shooter
that never hesitates.

00:12.599 --> 00:15.759
And that's what makes him
stronger than anyone.

00:25.559 --> 00:26.960
Now this is more like it.

00:27.640 --> 00:30.079
I knew from the very first time
I saw you that the opponent

00:30.559 --> 00:33.359
who would give me
enormous satisfaction

00:34.479 --> 00:36.280
was gonna be you!

01:04.599 --> 01:07.280
That's the stuff, baby.
I'm feeling it now.

01:07.640 --> 01:09.879
Your rage,
your thirst for blood.

01:09.959 --> 01:12.680
It's burning.
Burning hot.

01:13.200 --> 01:14.239
Here it comes.

01:15.159 --> 01:17.519
The surge of magma
welling up inside me.

01:17.920 --> 01:21.439
I'm about to erupt!

01:25.680 --> 01:26.719
What the hell?

01:26.799 --> 01:30.239
The more intensely that you visualize
your own actions,

01:38.079 --> 01:40.519
the faster and stronger
the suit will execute them.

01:41.040 --> 01:44.560
Bring it on, ninja boy!

02:10.919 --> 02:15.120
I couldn't do a damn
thing against you.

02:16.319 --> 02:19.280
So this is what a real ninja
is like, huh?

02:20.400 --> 02:22.080
Ah, but you know,

02:23.120 --> 02:24.159
I don't regret it.

02:27.000 --> 02:31.800
I don't even remember the last time
that I felt this content.

02:34.360 --> 02:35.520
So what do you say?

02:36.919 --> 02:38.919
Let's pop off together.

02:50.039 --> 02:51.639
God damn it!

02:53.840 --> 02:56.800
Your death will be
anything but quick and painless.

02:58.439 --> 03:01.080
You sadistic bastard.

04:28.959 --> 04:31.439
Come on! This was delivered
to our headquarters this morning.

04:32.839 --> 04:34.639
I would assume it's meant
as a warning.

04:34.720 --> 04:36.680
Holy moly.

04:36.759 --> 04:39.720
He must be something else to handle
the suit like that on his first try.

04:39.800 --> 04:42.240
I would love to get my hands
on that operational data.

04:42.759 --> 04:45.319
Is there any chance we could
negotiate with this guy, Dilly?

04:45.720 --> 04:47.759
It's highly unlikely that he would reply.

04:48.439 --> 04:50.839
Maybe we can convince him with cash.

04:51.199 --> 04:52.959
He might buy it if we offer him
a big payday, you know?

04:53.439 --> 04:54.600
Sounds ridiculous.

04:56.959 --> 04:59.160
I hope you're not going off
to avenge your little lackey.

05:00.480 --> 05:01.920
I'm speeding up the plan.

05:02.439 --> 05:05.040
Our great cause is all that matters.

05:10.120 --> 05:12.000
Spoken like a true ninja.

05:15.839 --> 05:18.120
Don't worry.
They won't do anything for now.

05:19.759 --> 05:21.560
The lieutenants
who wear the Gusoku Gear

05:21.639 --> 05:24.399
are regarded as having ultimate
power within the organization.

05:24.800 --> 05:26.639
But now you've shattered
that image.

05:27.439 --> 05:30.639
At the very least,
they won't make another move

05:30.720 --> 05:33.199
until they come up with
a surefire way to eliminate you.

05:35.360 --> 05:38.519
Do you still think back about
what the sky of Japan was like?

05:41.639 --> 05:43.639
Birds of passage need no home.

05:44.079 --> 05:47.360
The only thing reflected in their eyes
are the hills of a distant land.

05:48.000 --> 05:50.240
They take to the sky
with that in mind.

05:51.800 --> 05:53.199
Now there are only two.

05:54.600 --> 05:55.920
I will follow you
to the ends of the earth, Master.

06:02.560 --> 06:03.720
I shall stop you no longer.

06:05.399 --> 06:06.319
Go and end him.

06:06.800 --> 06:09.399
Higan shall perish by your hand.

06:15.519 --> 06:17.920
Staring at me like that
won't get you anywhere.

06:18.519 --> 06:21.959
Just to be crystal clear, I refuse to date
guys who are married with families.

06:23.759 --> 06:26.120
So what's on your mind?

06:26.199 --> 06:29.000
What relationship did you
and Mari have, exactly?

06:31.399 --> 06:32.959
She was my savior.

06:33.839 --> 06:37.040
If I hadn't met Mari,
I wouldn't be who I am today.

06:54.839 --> 06:55.759
I've caught a ninja.

07:00.360 --> 07:02.839
Even the briefest moment of
carelessness can lead to sure death.

07:02.920 --> 07:05.920
You'd do well to remember that, newbie.

07:09.199 --> 07:11.399
<i>I'm giving you passing marks
on your test.</i>

07:11.959 --> 07:13.639
<i>Starting today,
you're my partner.</i>

07:15.199 --> 07:18.079
<i>Mari was the first mentor
that I ever had.</i>

07:19.040 --> 07:21.199
<i>She took a smart and steadfast
approach to our missions</i>

07:21.279 --> 07:23.040
<i>and always completed them
without fail.</i>

07:24.319 --> 07:25.360
In my eyes,

07:26.079 --> 07:29.319
<i>she was the very embodiment of
what the ideal ninja should be.</i>

07:30.959 --> 07:33.600
<i>At that time, there were three
individuals in the organization</i>

07:33.680 --> 07:35.639
<i>who were known as the best
of the best...</i>

07:36.120 --> 07:39.079
Zai, you, and Mari.

07:40.399 --> 07:43.519
<i>Everyone was convinced that someday
one of you would reach the peak</i>

07:44.600 --> 07:46.319
and then inherit control
of the organization.

07:46.839 --> 07:51.439
Remember, to be a ninja is to be a
shadow that lives their life with pride.

07:52.240 --> 07:54.519
Cast aside any sense of self,
any emotion,

07:54.600 --> 07:57.399
and lay down your life
in defense of Japan.

07:57.839 --> 08:00.360
That is our most cherished dream.

08:00.839 --> 08:02.000
- Sir.
- Sir.

08:03.560 --> 08:05.360
Are you always wearing that?

08:06.600 --> 08:09.480
- Yes.
- Mind if I ask why?

08:17.079 --> 08:18.120
When I was a child,

08:18.800 --> 08:20.120
<i>my face was all smashed up
in an accident</i>

08:20.800 --> 08:22.600
<i>that left me
horribly disfigured.</i>

08:23.519 --> 08:26.560
<i>My mother and father
couldn't bear to look at me.</i>

08:28.360 --> 08:29.600
And so they left me there.

08:32.840 --> 08:36.679
<i>I was completely alone
until I got adopted by the organization.</i>

08:41.840 --> 08:44.559
You no longer have the face
of a respectable human.

08:48.279 --> 08:52.320
However, it is for that very reason you
may now transform yourself into anyone.

08:52.840 --> 08:55.720
So from now on,
you shall live your life as a ninja.

08:58.039 --> 09:02.000
<i>Those words guided me into learning
how to be a master of disguise</i>

09:03.399 --> 09:05.840
<i>so that I could transform myself
into whoever I wanted to be.</i>

09:05.919 --> 09:06.879
Take it off.

09:21.840 --> 09:22.759
You're gorgeous.

09:23.240 --> 09:25.720
Please don't pity me.
I know that I'm nothing but hideous.

09:25.799 --> 09:29.240
Wrong. I think you're the most
beautiful person I've ever seen.

09:31.120 --> 09:34.639
After all, your face, that is where all
of your pride as a ninja comes from.

09:39.039 --> 09:40.360
She was an extraordinary person.

09:40.960 --> 09:42.639
Her words were so convincing.

09:42.720 --> 09:45.879
I believed that whatever
she said was an obvious fact.

09:46.519 --> 09:50.799
I had nothing but respect for her, not
just as a ninja, but also as a human.

09:52.639 --> 09:54.279
I grew up with Higan and Zai.

09:54.759 --> 09:57.320
We trained with each other
ever since we were little kids.

09:57.840 --> 10:00.320
Well, with those two,
they're just too awe-inspiring for me

10:00.399 --> 10:01.840
to even think about getting close.

10:02.159 --> 10:04.360
There's honestly nothing
for you to be afraid of.

10:04.440 --> 10:06.559
They're actually quite childish,
despite how they look.

10:10.039 --> 10:12.720
- What? Did that really happen?
- Adorable, aren't they?

10:14.159 --> 10:16.639
Those two,
they're very precious to me.

10:18.360 --> 10:20.480
It worries me a little.

10:21.080 --> 10:23.240
Growing attached like that
gives rise to emotion,

10:23.559 --> 10:26.559
and those feelings can end up
distracting you on the battlefield.

10:26.639 --> 10:29.159
That's why the code forbid us
from such attachments.

10:30.360 --> 10:32.960
Emotions are
what get ninjas killed.

10:37.840 --> 10:41.919
<i>Loathing both the oceans
of life and death,</i>

10:42.639 --> 10:45.840
<i>I yearn for a mountain untouched
by the tides of change.</i>

10:53.399 --> 10:55.080
Now you know my secret art.

10:57.000 --> 10:58.879
I can make it appear
like someone has died

10:58.960 --> 11:01.960
by putting their body in a state
of suspended animation.

11:02.440 --> 11:04.240
I'm going to pass down
this technique to you.

11:05.000 --> 11:06.840
But I was told the secret arts

11:06.919 --> 11:09.200
were something you never revealed
to anyone in any circumstance.

11:10.399 --> 11:13.919
I'm doing this because the day will come
when you'll need to use it.

11:15.080 --> 11:16.720
Looking back on those moments,

11:16.799 --> 11:19.960
I think that may have been
the happiest time of my life.

11:21.000 --> 11:22.120
But then...

11:24.039 --> 11:25.799
it ended very abruptly.

11:39.000 --> 11:40.240
How deplorable.

11:41.120 --> 11:45.360
A true ninja is one that keeps
a heart under their blade.

11:46.000 --> 11:50.000
These outsiders are here just
for the weapons and to kill people.

11:50.799 --> 11:53.000
Why would you work
with these lowlifes,

11:54.000 --> 11:55.200
Master Yamaji?

11:56.720 --> 11:58.759
The training is proceeding as planned.

11:59.320 --> 12:00.879
That completes my report.

12:04.320 --> 12:05.360
Tell me something.

12:07.879 --> 12:10.000
What do you think is a ninja's pride?

12:11.960 --> 12:13.080
Protecting the peace of Japan.

12:13.759 --> 12:17.480
And if Japan were to disappear forever,
would the ninja go along with it,

12:17.559 --> 12:19.519
fading away like mere shadows?

12:21.840 --> 12:23.159
I'm not sure.

12:37.399 --> 12:41.279
Do you think the organization is on
the verge of undergoing radical change?

12:42.279 --> 12:44.320
I really hope not.

12:45.679 --> 12:48.559
But if you become the new Chieftain
and lead the organization, then maybe--

12:48.639 --> 12:52.360
Forget about that. There's something
that I've been meaning to tell you.

12:54.360 --> 12:56.559
There's a baby growing inside me.

12:56.919 --> 12:58.840
But... But how?

12:59.960 --> 13:01.960
Because I fell in love with someone.

13:05.639 --> 13:08.799
There's no place for me here
now that I have broken the code.

13:15.080 --> 13:16.759
I gotta say, this feels pretty weird.

13:17.080 --> 13:19.759
And in just a few more months,
you'll be able to feel it kick.

13:20.279 --> 13:23.360
- Did you just say it kicks?
- Yes. It's amazing, isn't it?

13:27.039 --> 13:29.519
Being a ninja is the only way
I know how to live.

13:30.960 --> 13:34.440
But now I guess I'm going
to have to become a father.

13:35.679 --> 13:37.799
Do you think I can handle it?

13:40.679 --> 13:43.519
You're not alone in this.
We'll be parents together.

13:59.679 --> 14:03.399
It's been decided that our organization
shall leave the jurisdiction of Japan

14:03.960 --> 14:06.639
and fall under the command
of a greater power.

14:07.159 --> 14:09.200
Those who disobey
this decision or defect

14:09.279 --> 14:12.399
because of it shall be branded
exiles and exterminated.

14:13.000 --> 14:15.879
We're abandoning Japan?

14:18.159 --> 14:21.960
Master Yamaji, without their pride,
a ninja is as good as dead.

14:22.799 --> 14:25.519
Why can't you understand that?
Yamaji?

14:28.159 --> 14:31.279
Your goal has always been to take over
the organization all for yourself.

14:31.360 --> 14:33.799
It's clear that this fool
is no longer one of us.

14:34.200 --> 14:36.639
He has become consumed
with greed like a dog.

14:37.039 --> 14:40.000
A dog, you say.
And what if I was?

14:40.440 --> 14:41.440
You have to ask?

14:41.519 --> 14:43.639
- You shall die and rot where you stand.
- Wait!

15:16.600 --> 15:18.919
I am the true embodiment
of the ninja way.

15:19.840 --> 15:23.960
Therefore, the ninja will never
die so long as I shall live.

15:28.360 --> 15:30.440
There is only one path for us to take now.

15:30.519 --> 15:32.159
So you intend to kill Yamaji?

15:32.240 --> 15:34.399
- Please join our cause.
- You mustn't.

15:35.360 --> 15:39.200
I won't deny that it may be possible, but
we must work together to defeat him.

15:39.559 --> 15:43.639
Yet I am certain it will claim
all of our lives in the process.

15:44.200 --> 15:45.320
If that happens,

15:45.679 --> 15:49.399
the spirit of the ninja that's been passed
down through the centuries will vanish.

15:49.759 --> 15:51.759
And for us,
that will mean true death.

15:52.759 --> 15:53.919
Let us flee this place.

15:54.440 --> 15:56.519
Our will may be passed down
if we survive,

15:56.600 --> 16:00.399
even if that means bearing the
disgrace of becoming fugitives.

16:00.480 --> 16:02.039
That is our resolve now.

16:06.480 --> 16:07.399
What do you want?

16:12.720 --> 16:15.639
By using this, we can all flee
far away from the organization

16:15.720 --> 16:17.360
without ever being discovered.

16:21.360 --> 16:24.559
It's something that I've worked on
independently for a very long time.

16:24.639 --> 16:26.480
I hope that one day it will help
someone.

16:27.200 --> 16:29.399
Please take it and use it
for the sake of our allies.

16:30.639 --> 16:31.879
You have my thanks.

16:33.480 --> 16:36.240
Take good care of your child.

16:47.200 --> 16:48.279
Why are you here?

16:49.960 --> 16:51.279
If you must know,

16:51.360 --> 16:54.919
the previous Chieftain gave me a
top-secret mission to carry out.

16:55.360 --> 16:59.240
That duty involves determining whether
the next candidate to be our leader

16:59.320 --> 17:01.200
is truly worthy of the role or not.

17:01.759 --> 17:05.519
And in the event that they prove
unworthy, to bury them.

17:06.480 --> 17:08.319
But the Chieftain
has been dead for some time.

17:08.400 --> 17:09.839
Which is all the more reason.

17:09.920 --> 17:11.440
If I don't carry
this mission through,

17:11.519 --> 17:13.359
then his wishes will be lost
along with everything else.

17:14.240 --> 17:15.720
I'm sorry for deceiving you.

17:16.880 --> 17:19.720
I already knew what you were
from the first time we met.

17:20.799 --> 17:21.720
Please.

17:23.279 --> 17:25.640
Just please let that baby go

17:26.279 --> 17:28.720
and then live
as a ninja once again.

17:37.440 --> 17:39.799
That figures. You were hiding your true
power this whole time, weren't you?

17:39.880 --> 17:43.000
Lies and deception are tools that I use
to uphold my duty as the watcher.

17:45.920 --> 17:49.200
To tell you the truth, I can't even recall
what my parents looked like.

17:49.599 --> 17:50.960
But whenever I try to remember,

17:52.200 --> 17:53.799
it's your face that comes to mind.

17:56.839 --> 17:57.839
Nevertheless.

18:13.480 --> 18:14.640
It seems I've lost.

18:15.119 --> 18:18.319
At the very last second,
you made a move to cover for your baby.

18:19.400 --> 18:20.599
You would have won otherwise.

18:21.519 --> 18:23.920
- You going to kill me now?
- I don't know.

18:25.079 --> 18:28.279
Everything is unclear to me and I'm not
sure what I should do anymore.

18:29.119 --> 18:31.440
All I ever wanted
was to live as a ninja.

18:31.519 --> 18:34.000
But now the organization
is nothing like it was before.

18:35.279 --> 18:38.240
Fleeing from it and spending the rest
of my days as a ninja in hiding,

18:38.319 --> 18:40.000
there's no pride to be found in that.

18:40.480 --> 18:42.599
I hate the idea of living
such a pathetic life.

18:43.400 --> 18:46.400
So at the very least, I want
to go out like a ninja should.

18:52.599 --> 18:56.240
Ninjas don't have emotions
and thus cannot know what family is.

18:56.960 --> 18:59.640
But this baby,
it gave me a family,

19:00.440 --> 19:02.680
and now it's become
my new reason to live.

19:03.440 --> 19:05.680
Emotions are not something
that gets ninjas killed.

19:05.759 --> 19:06.759
They actually give them life.

19:07.799 --> 19:08.839
So please live on.

19:09.559 --> 19:12.359
You have always been someone
I consider part of my family.

19:17.720 --> 19:18.920
And so do I.

19:24.359 --> 19:26.240
What are you going to do now?

19:28.279 --> 19:32.240
<i>I will remain as a member
of the organization for now.</i>

19:33.200 --> 19:34.680
Someone needs to stay behind

19:35.079 --> 19:37.240
<i>and keep track of what
they're doing from the inside.</i>

19:38.640 --> 19:41.559
<i>That will definitely put me in
the position to help our allies.</i>

19:42.920 --> 19:47.000
And also, I still have my duty
as the watcher left to fulfill.

19:49.200 --> 19:52.359
<i>I've been sent on a new mission
to infiltrate the FBI.</i>

19:53.000 --> 19:54.799
<i>My boss there has
some bad habits,</i>

19:55.400 --> 19:57.319
<i>but he seems to be
a good person at heart.</i>

19:57.640 --> 19:59.359
Well, every day is a battle for us.

20:00.079 --> 20:02.519
<i>I had no idea that raising
a child was this difficult.</i>

20:02.599 --> 20:05.079
<i>I might be struggling more now
than I ever did as a ninja.</i>

20:09.279 --> 20:12.720
Whenever Mari fought,
her goal was always to defend.

20:13.559 --> 20:16.599
I honestly believe
she exemplified a true ninja.

20:19.839 --> 20:21.079
And that's why I knew

20:21.160 --> 20:23.680
I had to see my duty through
to the end, no matter what.

20:24.759 --> 20:26.200
So while I was
in the organization,

20:26.279 --> 20:28.880
I did some digging and found out
what the Chieftain,

20:29.559 --> 20:31.000
what Yamaji is doing.

20:31.759 --> 20:33.519
What exactly are
they trying to accomplish?

20:33.920 --> 20:34.960
At this moment,

20:37.160 --> 20:39.200
he's executing his master plan.

20:44.000 --> 20:48.920
Revised and Synchronized by
FAST TITLES MEDIA
